the separate meta-analysis of this study reveals a sustainedeffect of ICBT on anxiety and depression during final follow-up(P<.05), which provides further evidence for the promotionof ICBT in clinical practice.
This meta-analysis showed a nonsignificant combined effectsize of ICBT on fatigue and fear of cancer recurrence (P>.05).
Although the etiology of fatigue is unknown, studies have sug-gested that it may be related to biological mechanisms such asproinflammatory cytokines and dysregulation of the hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal axis.69,70 In addition, as the disease progresses,cancer will lead to persistent physical, emotional, or cognitivedistress;

